{"channelId":"UC_izZVX8jND3sVsOVvHHh6w","row":["Fever Equine Services",67,"Services include: \nSHOEING -- TRAINING -- MAINTENANCE -- EQUINE CONSULTING -- CLINICS -- CUSTOM HAULING -- EQUINE FACILITY DESIGN.\n\nThe services I provide are intended to improve equine performance and overall horsemanship. I am currently standing at 10 years of being a farrier. So far I have trained over a thousand head of horses - these horses have competed in all levels of rodeo (roping, barrels and poles). I am fortunate enough to train some trail versatility and ranch horses, too. Also, from East to West Coast, I custom-haul horses that value in the millions.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_izZVX8jND3sVsOVvHHh6w","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_izZVX8jND3sVsOVvHHh6w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:15.908Z","channelId":"UC_izZVX8jND3sVsOVvHHh6w","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"1b36a8796e767ea0e499606daf4c72ac5e0cfeaf802804c8f7d377a6dab1464d","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"f9d4fe551d168f74b6e64830e3e12a9876c393317e6f597ec39eadce822ea530"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_izZVX8jND3sVsOVvHHh6w","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":67,"raw":"67 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_izZVX8jND3sVsOVvHHh6w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:15.908Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"chiropractors","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"undetermined","excerpt":"INE FACILITY DESIGN.\n\nThe services I provide are intended to improve equine performance and overall horsemanship. I am current